			"notes": "### Features\n\n- add HDR tonemap operators, prune legacy velocity-fill code, and apply comment discipline (5d0076c)\n- 26.3 migration baseline, tonemap presentation, and motion clip fix (2c33e6b)\n- add Ray Reconstruction model preset selection and controls (a26ac64)\n- port to 26.3 snapshot-9 and extract Vulkan device handling (a018678)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- restore non-dev environment loading and clean up test fixtures (6498528)\n\n### Refactoring\n\n- remove keybinds and unify UI settings and debug readout (f294e42)\n- purge legacy MRT velocity writers and enforce camera-only motion for 26.3 (2f4f2bf)\n\n### Documentation\n\n- keep what's new high-level and feature-focused (573ff52)\n- add 2.0.0 what's new and simplify RR API section (6eb650f)\n- update README for 2.0.0 release (ea2fc26)\n\n### Build & CI\n\n- exclude live-GPU nativeBridgeTest on headless GitHub runners (a2d1fd9)\n- add Windows build CI and GitHub release workflow (d73cec1)\n\n### Chores\n\n- bump mc-dlss to 2.0.0 and update 26.3 dependencies (bd26a93)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/snowmii/mc-dlss/compare/v1.0.1...v2.0.0"
